  "description": "The Elf Bar JoinOne15 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit brings a new level of versatility to the prefilled pod category, blending long-lasting performance with the trusted simplicity Elf Bar users expect. Designed for convenience without compromise, the JoinOne15 is designed to be used solo in a streamlined, screen-free design. or paired up in combo mode with a dual battery system 1000mAh battery + 150mAh battery with a vivid HD display screen, Both versions deliver the same crisp, satisfying mouth-to-lung (MTL) experience using magnetic tech to attach neatly to each other. Powering up to an estimated 20,000 puffs per kit, the JoinOne15 uses replaceable 2 ml pods paired with 10 ml refill containers to provide extended use between replacements. The built-in dual-mesh coil heats e-liquid evenly for consistent flavour and vapour output, while the 20 mg Nic Salt formulation ensures smooth, fast-acting nicotine delivery. The device recharges fully in around 35 minutes via USB-C fast charge, and a sliding airflow control allows you to fine-tune your draw from tight to airy. Users can toggle between Normal, Turbo and Boost modes using the power button to adjust warmth and vapour density to taste. The Dynamic edition’s 2.25-inch display provides at-a-glance details such as battery level and mode setting, while the Lumeo focuses on simplicity and all-day endurance. Whichever version you choose, the JoinOne15 offers a balanced combination of power, flavour consistency, and convenience in a compact form suited to everyday use. Please Note: When replacing the Prefilled pod + Refill simply remove the empty pod + Refill from the smaller battery (the one with no screen) and replace with the new full pod + refill. Elf Bar JoinOne15 Kit Flavours • Blue Razz Lemonade • Cola • Triple Mango • Grape • Watermelon Ice • Strawberry Watermelon • Kiwi Passionfruit Guava • Juicy Peach • Blueberry • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice • Strawberry Kiwi • Fresh Mint • Pink Lemonade • Summer 